<title>FINLAND: Konecranes proposes FIM 3.00 1996 dividend.</title>
<headline>Konecranes proposes FIM 3.00 1996 dividend.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>					   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Proposed dividend (markka)		    3.00 vs 2.00</p>
<p> Profit after financial items		 208.2 vs 135.3</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)		   9.26 vs 6.33</p>
<p> Net sales					2,450.9 vs 2,182.6</p>
<p> Operating profit				 207.7 vs 141.2</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts' median dividend forecast for cranes maker KCI Konecranes International Oy had been 2.60 markka (mean 2.70 markka) in a 2.40-3.50 markka range.</p>
<p>NOTE - Company reported preliminary 1996 earnings on Feb 5.  </p>
<p>--Helsinki Newsroom  +358 - 9 - 680 50 245</p>
</text>
